  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T20:08:10.852709Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T20:21:47.462638Z",
  "totalBlocks": 20,
  "translatedBlocks": 20,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "215adf4706357ffe",
      "translationZh": "我有一台 strix halo，128GB 内存，使用 GTT 后有 120GB 可用，可以运行 105GB 及以下的模型，一直用得挺好。但随着形势变化，我想稍微升级一下。欢迎大家提建议！（如果发现有什么错误，也请告诉我！）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7ebe0a369acbd99",
      "translationZh": "目标 1——更快地运行 27B 稠密模型（例如 Qwen 3.8，我目前运行它的速度是 10t/s）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de3032bac3b5cccd",
      "translationZh": "目标 2——运行大于 105GB 的模型（例如包含 Dflash 的 0731）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61bacc32f70ad8f4",
      "translationZh": "我花了几天时间配置 m.2 > oculink DEG1 > 4070 TI super（16GB）这套连接方案，并从中了解到 3 件事",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81f553f7ce5a35af",
      "translationZh": "1——它并没有让拆分运行的模型或稠密模型跑得更快（4070 闲着，等 radeon 跟上进度）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abb723abf39bd9ad",
      "translationZh": "2——它对换入换出 moe 层没有帮助（通过 PCIe 换入换出模型太慢了）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1e1db9717f885fa",
      "translationZh": "2——它对能运行的模型大小也没带来多大改变（+10%，还要记住，如果逼得太紧、把整整 16GB 都用上，电脑就会崩溃）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6667527505d5dc9",
      "translationZh": "所以我面临一个选择：把 4070 放回我的游戏电脑后，我该找一张 32GB 的显卡，还是一张 48GB 的显卡？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5898c9a34256165",
      "translationZh": "（关于我：我的职业涉及系统管理、编程和基础设施，所以这些都与工作有关）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd616e6da8262ed8",
      "translationZh": "它的容量只是刚好够以还算不错的量化精度完整容纳 Qwen3.8，不过在小到中等上下文长度下，这能让 3.8 运行得快得多，也让 xhigh 推理不至于拖垮我的工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c44601a96241d2a9",
      "translationZh": "它让我能以 Q4 量化运行 0731，并使用 dflash（前提是我买一张 AMD 显卡，比如 7900，因为显然不能混用 nvidia 和 AMD，再把 dflash 拆分到不同架构上运行？），通过推测解码提升慢速／推理模型的性能（所以速度提升并不是来自 VRAM）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed0155edf80b7557",
      "translationZh": "它会把可用 RAM 增加到 132GB，算是小幅提升，能够运行量化精度较好的新版 3.8 flash。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20e15a2a555df7fc",
      "translationZh": "未来再买第二张 32GB 显卡，总价仍会比单张 48GB 显卡便宜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97d97567c104bc87",
      "translationZh": "2x32GB 会占用两个 m.2 插槽，因此我的互连接口就全占满了（之后我会用一个 PCIe>m.2 转接器来连接本地存储）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39683d4d72090f00",
      "translationZh": "缺点是，这样我的容量上限就定在了 196GB（而不是下述方案的 224GB）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e350e3d08c9b49f",
      "translationZh": "能容纳 27B 稠密模型，而且能支持长得多的上下文，从而支持子智能体／并行运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "012aae3c22f8207b",
      "translationZh": "可运行的 GGUF 模型最大可达 153GB，能够用大型但速度较慢的模型处理夜间工作负载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "141b09ed4cc3ee71",
      "translationZh": "如果我中了彩票，将来能买得起第二块，专用 eGPU 的容量就能扩展到 96GB，这样在运行中等规模模型时就能有相当不错的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bd5da8f544ab7e2",
      "translationZh": "我觉得自己没法证明买 48GB 的是划算的，但又担心买 32GB 的会不会反而因小失大？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44fcef5c14d80353",
      "translationZh": "欢迎大家提出任何想法，拜托了！！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
